    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u12.d05.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Talking about experiences",
        "ru": "Говорим об опыте"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "Ask about experiences with \"Have you ever …?\". Answer \"Yes, I have / No, I haven't / I've never …\". Add details in the past simple with \"What was it like?\".",
        "ru": "Спрашивай об опыте: \"Have you ever …?\". Отвечай \"Yes, I have / No, I haven't / I've never …\". Детали — в past simple, вопрос \"What was it like?\"."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "ask",
            "ru": "вопрос"
          },
          "formula": "Have you ever + V3?",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Have you ever ridden a horse?",
              "ru": "Ты когда-нибудь катался на лошади?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "answer",
            "ru": "ответ"
          },
          "formula": "Yes, I have. / No, I haven't.",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Yes, I have! / No, I've never done that.",
              "ru": "Да! / Нет, я такого не делал."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "details",
            "ru": "детали"
          },
          "formula": "What was it like? + past simple",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "What was it like? It was amazing!",
              "ru": "Как это было? Потрясающе!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "Answer with the auxiliary: \"Yes, I have\", not \"Yes, I have been\".",
          "ru": "Отвечай вспомогательным: \"Yes, I have\", а не \"Yes, I have been\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "Switch to the past simple for details and time: \"It was in 2019\".",
          "ru": "Для деталей и времени переходи на past simple: \"It was in 2019\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u12.d05.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "Two friends talk",
        "ru": "Разговор двух друзей"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u12.d05.reading.b1",
          "en": "\"Have you ever tried surfing?\" asked Kate. \"Yes, I have! I tried it in Portugal last year.\" \"Wow! What was it like?\" \"It was amazing but difficult.\"",
          "ru": "«Ты когда-нибудь пробовала сёрфинг?» — спросила Кейт. «Да! Я пробовала в Португалии в прошлом году». «Ух ты! Как это было?» «Потрясающе, но сложно».",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u12.d05.reading.b1.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u12.d05.reading.b2",
          "en": "\"Have you ever met a famous person?\" \"No, I've never met one. But I've seen a singer at the airport once. That was an interesting experience!\"",
          "ru": "«А ты когда-нибудь встречала знаменитость?» «Нет, ни разу. Но однажды я видела певца в аэропорту. Это было интересное впечатление!»",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u12.d05.reading.b2.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
